2. REUSE Specification Compliance
---------------------------------
Craftpack strictly complies with version 3.3 of the REUSE Specification
(https://reuse.software/). Every source and documentation file contains explicit
and machine-readable SPDX copyright and license identifiers:

    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Marcin Kaim
    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Project-wide licensing and copyright compliance can be verified using the
REUSE tool (`reuse lint`).

